@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L4：RocketMQ4 Provider 发送结果映射

participant RocketMqMessageProvider as Provider
participant DefaultMQProducer as Producer
queue RocketMQBroker as Broker
participant "ProviderSendResult" as Result

Provider -> Producer: send(Message)
Producer -> Broker: Remoting publish

alt SendStatus = SEND_OK
  Broker --> Producer: SendResult(SEND_OK, msgId)
  Producer --> Provider: SendResult
  Provider -> Result: CONFIRMED + providerMessageId=msgId
else SendStatus = FLUSH_DISK_TIMEOUT
  Broker --> Producer: SendResult(FLUSH_DISK_TIMEOUT)
  Provider -> Result: UNKNOWN + TIMEOUT
else SendStatus = FLUSH_SLAVE_TIMEOUT
  Broker --> Producer: SendResult(FLUSH_SLAVE_TIMEOUT)
  Provider -> Result: UNKNOWN + UNKNOWN_OUTCOME
else SendStatus = SLAVE_NOT_AVAILABLE
  Broker --> Producer: SendResult(SLAVE_NOT_AVAILABLE)
  Provider -> Result: UNKNOWN + UNKNOWN_OUTCOME
else RemotingConnectException / RemotingTimeoutException before broker accept
  Producer --> Provider: exception
  Provider -> Result: FAILED + NETWORK_ERROR
else MQClientException 参数错误 / topic 错误 / 权限错误
  Producer --> Provider: exception
  Provider -> Result: REJECTED + CLIENT_ERROR / BROKER_REJECTED
else future or call timeout
  Producer --x Provider: no final acknowledgement
  Provider -> Result: UNKNOWN + TIMEOUT
end

note over Provider,Result
RocketMQ4 的 FLUSH_* / SLAVE_NOT_AVAILABLE 不是简单“没发出去”。
消息可能已经到达 Broker，只是同步刷盘或主从确认未满足，第一版保守映射 UNKNOWN。
end note
@enduml
